sqrt[4]{x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= \\int\\left(x^{4}+x^{\\frac{1}{4}}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= \\int x^{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x+\\int x^{\\frac{1}{4}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= \\left(\\frac{x^{5}}{5}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{x^{\\frac{5}{4}}}{\\frac{5}{4}}\\right)+C\\\\ &= \\frac{x^{5}}{5}+\\frac{4\\sqrt[4]{x^{5}}}{5}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe constant $C$ is already supplied outside the blank."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186671328 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "18440319-7c8f-5338-8cff-052c9e61985f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7x^{4}}{10}-5x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671185} {:answer/id #uuid "575958a7-8c80-5f77-b94c-4cb1714e5be6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{8x^{4}}{7}-5x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671209} {:answer/id #uuid "5d4ab299-f660-50b2-a255-ed1868d91cce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7x^{4}}{2}-5x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671211} {:answer/id #uuid "86aa52ec-f946-5f51-aa01-6c1454596da1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{4}}{8}-5x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671226} {:answer/id #uuid "9678293c-3dce-5e81-bd4e-dbae2c620a01" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{4}}{4}-5x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671236}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9678293c-3dce-5e81-bd4e-dbae2c620a01" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{4}}{4}-5x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671236} :answer-field/id #uuid "23a15c0f-fe53-54eb-ae59-4912a4fa1b01" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671291}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "3a27c4f3-d27b-5e25-9173-418c55051d58" :question/problem "Calculate $$\n\\displaystyle\\int x^{3}-5\\,\\mathrm{d}x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Rewrite as powers, apply the sum and constant factor rules, and integrate each term using $$\n\\displaystyle \\int x^p\\,\\mathrm{d}x=x^{p+1}/(p+1)+C\n$$ for $p\\ne-1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int x^{3}-5\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= \\int\\left(x^{3}-5\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= \\int x^{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x-5\\int x^{0}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= \\left(\\frac{x^{4}}{4}\\right)-5\\left(\\frac{x^{1}}{1}\\right)+C\\\\ &= \\frac{x^{4}}{4}-5x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186671329 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9efd7a2e-8395-52d9-a285-02c1147fc742" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{4\\sqrt[4]{x^{5}}}{5}-\\frac{x^{6}}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671239}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9efd7a2e-8395-52d9-a285-02c1147fc742" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{4\\sqrt[4]{x^{5}}}{5}-\\frac{x^{6}}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671239} :answer-field/id #uuid "eeb94853-bd1d-5f61-9820-db479de88a73" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186671315}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "3c7bf230-bb15-5c91-9b5d-59d6bbb6cba9" :question/problem "Find the antiderivative:\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle\\int -\\sqrt[4]{x}-x^{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\n$$\n{{field-1}}\n$+C$. Assume $x>0$." :question/worked-solution "Rewrite as powers, apply the sum and constant factor rules, and integrate each term using $$\n\\displaystyle \\int x^p\\,\\mathrm{d}x=x^{p+1}/(p+1)+C\n$$ for $p\\ne-1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}& \\int -\\sqrt[4]{x}-x^{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= \\int\\left(-x^{\\frac{1}{4}}-x^{5}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &= -\\int x^{\\frac{1}{4}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x-\